{"reference":"2 Samuel 4","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":4,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within 2 Samuel","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"This chapter belongs to a book that moves from David's accession and kingdom consolidation through the ark and the promise of a dynasty, then into royal abuse, violence within David's household, rebellion, grief, and a four-part closing appendix.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_004_9fb5aeca07ab218c27ac10ac"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}